# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules

# The build output, except one placeholder: `//go:embed all:dist` in
# ../web/embed.go needs the directory to be non-empty, or a fresh checkout does
# not compile at all. Excluding `dist` outright would win over the root
# .gitignore's exception, because git will not re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded.
dist/*
!dist/.gitkeep
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
